# Black Rain Labs branding

The product is **Corvus-Node**. `corvus` is only the operator CLI. Never call this product Corvus (a different creator's project).

Commits, docs, CLI copy, and comments are **Black Rain Labs - Research & Development Division**. No "Made by", "Created by", "Generated by", or `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (including `cursoragent@cursor.com`).

GitHub **Contributors** (human PR authors and human `Co-authored-by` lines) are allowed.

Never add Cursor as an author. If a commit wrapper injects a Cursor trailer, strip it with `packaging/strip-ai-trailers.sh` (or `.githooks/commit-msg`) in a subshell so `GIT_AUTHOR_DATE` is not exported. Unset `GIT_AUTHOR_DATE` / `GIT_COMMITTER_DATE` afterward.

Do not copy dates from an older commit when rewriting.
